---
/**
 * The TL;DR grid at the top of every topic: the answer before the article.
 * Marked `data-depth="quick"` so it is the one block Quick mode always shows.
 * Cells come from `<TLDRCell label="…">` children. The `tldr` id is what the table of contents
 * links to at Quick depth; a topic carries one TL;DR, so the id stays unique.
 */
---

<div id="tldr" class="tldr" data-depth="quick"><slot /></div>
